File Name: KeettaKa Dijskatra's Algorithm + Graph

User Records

Store each KeettaKa user's name, password, and automatically
Inputs are loaded from accounts.txt when the program starts.
Each new ID is checked so it stays unique. Login searches the file by ID and compares the password.

Shortest Route and Best Finder

Keep the shortest distance, the route path, and the finder's details in each route record. The key is the start and destination IDs, and the path comes from Dijkstra's algorithm.
When a new route is shorter than the saved one, update that record with the new distance, path, and user. This can happen after a new road is added to the graph.
The final path is drawn on the KeettaKa map page (map.html) using MapLibre.
